*.egg-info/

# Vortex runtime state (VORTEX_HOME). Defaults to ~/.vortex, but pointing it at the
# repo is a normal dev workflow — without these rules a run would commit the agent's
# database, learned memory, and queued self-modifications.
.vortex/
memory.db
memory.db-wal
memory.db-shm
vectors.json
bug_patterns.json
MEMORY.md
USER.md
skills/
releases/
traces/
**/sovereign/state.json
**/governance/audit.jsonl
pending_mutations/
mutation_backups/
workspace/

# Sandbox scratch from the self-modification engine
vortex_sandbox_*/
```